From a936bc2114714cb994fb74af6d7e0f9a5515bcc8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dinesh Kumar Mirche <dmirche@habana.ai>
Date: Mon, 10 Jun 2024 14:01:52 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-179793] gaudi3: sec: enable security in erom

This patch enables the security functionality for
erom recovery. This patch configures the protections
bits and range registers to protect the unauthorized
access to registers during erom recovery.

As many of these functions are used in preboot rtos
also in future common code will be created for legacy
preboot an preboot rtos.

Change-Id: I82c37e1f58b0bf6b856196c20749d8054ccc9a91
Signed-off-by: Dinesh Kumar Mirche <dmirche@habana.ai>
---

